eight":480},"800x600":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1472118/3cc34135-2359-4c6e-bffb-1b5be86bbed5.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}}],"videos":null,"description":"(English above)\nPerfekt für Berufstätige oder Studenten oder Pendler: Loft gemütlich und zentral zur Altstadt (möbliert)\n\nMöbliertes Apartment für Kurz- oder Langzeitmiete an seriöse/n Student/in oder Auszubildende/n zu vermieten. Das ruhige Studio befindet sich in einem Mehrfamilienhaus in Lemgo, nur 1-3 Minuten zu Fuß zur charmanten Innenstadt/Altstadt.\n\nMit ca. 40 m2 bietet das Loft:\n\nFlur\nBürobereich\nSchlafbereich\nBad mit Badewanne\nKüche\nWohnzimmer\nZusätzlich stehen ein Einbauschrank im Flur und ein Abstellraum im Keller zur Verfügung. Ein Garagenparkplatz kann auf Wunsch separat angemietet werden, sodass Sie Ihr Auto entspannt in der Garage parken können.\n\nIn direkter Umgebung finden Sie Restaurants, eine Stadtbushaltestelle und einen Biomarkt. Das Hallenbad ist fußläufig erreichbar, und die Innenstadt von Lemgo liegt nur 200 Meter entfernt.\n\nDieses Studio eignet sich hervorragend für Studenten, Berufstätige oder Auszubildende. Die vorherige Mieterin, eine junge Frau, hat sich hier sehr wohlgefühlt.\n\nWeitere Infos:\n\nDie Bilder sind aktuell.\nDie Wohnung ist ab sofort verfügbar.\nDie Küche (EKB) ist im Mietpreis enthalten und voll funktionsfähig.\n\nEnglish: \n\nPerfect for working people or students or commuters: cozy loft and central to the old town (furnished)\n\nFurnished apartment for short or long term rental to serious students or trainees. The quiet studio is located in an apartment building in Lemgo, just a 1-3 minute walk to the charming city center/old town.\n\nWith approximately 40 m2, the loft offers:\n\nHallway\nOffice area\nsleeping area\nBathroom with bathtub\nKitchen\nLiving room\nThere is also a built-in cupboard in the hallway and a storage room in (hidden)ment. A garage parking space can be rented separately if desired, so that you can park your car in the garage with ease.\n\nIn the immediate vicinity you will find restaurants, a city bus stop and an organic market. The indoor swimming pool is within walking distance and Lemgo city center is only 200 meters away.\n\nThis studio is ideal for students, professionals or trainees. The previous tenant, a young woman, felt very comfortable here.\n\nFurther information:\n\nThe pictures are current.\nThe apartment is available immediately.\nThe kitchen (EKB) is included in the rental price and is fully functional.\n\n","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"allergyFriendly":{"value":"no"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"private"},"basement":{"value":"private"},"bathroom":{"value":"private"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomLock":{"value":"yes"},"bedrooms":{"value":"0"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"yes"},"desk":{"value":"yes"},"dishwasher":{"value":"no"},"dryer":{"value":"no"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"no"},"flooring":{"value":"laminate"},"garden":{"value":"private"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"no"},"gender":{"value":"female"},"heating":{"value":"gas"},"internetCostIncluded":{"value":"no"},"kitchen":{"value":"private"},"kitchenware":{"value":"private"},"livingRoom":{"value":"private"},"parking":{"value":"no"},"pets":{"value":"discussable"},"playMusic":{"value":"no"},"registrationPossible":{"value":"yes"},"roomFurniture":{"value":"yes"},"smoking":{"value":"outside_only"},"toilet":{"value":"private"},"totalSize":{"value":"40"},"tv":{"value":"yes"},"washingMachine":{"value":"yes"},"waterCostIncluded":{"value":"no"},"wheelchairAccessible":{"value":"no"},"wifi":{"value":"yes"}},"costs":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":69900,"deposit":100000,"agencyFee":0,"estimatedBills":0},"costsFormatted":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":"699.00","deposit":"1000.00","agencyFee":"0.00","estimatedBills":"0.00"},"minimumStayMonths":2,"move